From 28d6a2bae0d8c1ba3645cd404504df28b51ba0cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Linglin Jing <linglinj@cw-dfw-cs-001-vscode-01.cm.cluster>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 16:38:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add Apptainer provider support for OSWorld runtime.

Enable apptainer as a first-class provider and make network/port behavior configurable so OSWorld can run on HPC nodes without Docker while preserving existing workflow compatibility.
